This page lists everything this website loads from, or sends to, someone other than us. It supports our [Website Privacy Notice](/website-privacy).

## Cookies

atelieroptimatix.com does **not** set advertising, analytics or tracking cookies, so there is no cookie banner to accept. If that changes, we will ask for your consent first and update this page.

## Local storage on your device

This website registers a service worker, which stores copies of the site's own pages and images in your browser so they load faster and work with a weak connection. It contains no personal information and you can clear it in your browser's site settings.

## Third-party services

{% callout type="note" %}
When your browser loads a resource from another company, that company receives your IP address and standard browser information, as with any web request. That is why we list them.
{% /callout %}

| Service | Provider | Purpose | When it loads | What it can see |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Web fonts | Google Fonts (Google) | Displays the site's typefaces | Every page | IP address, browser and the requested fonts |
| Script library | jsDelivr (CDN) | Delivers interface scripts (menus, copy-to-clipboard) | Every page | IP address and browser |
| Hosting | GitHub Pages (GitHub, Microsoft) | Serves the website | Every page | IP address, browser, requested pages |
| Spam protection | Cloudflare Turnstile | Checks that a contact-form sender is a person | Contact page, when enabled | IP address, browser signals, and a token it issues |
| Enquiry handling | Central Intelligence Atelier (operated by us) | Receives contact-form messages | When you send the form | The form contents and the anti-spam signals |

Their own policies apply to what they do with the data: [Google](https://policies.google.com/privacy), [jsDelivr](https://www.jsdelivr.com/terms/privacy-policy-jsdelivr-net), [GitHub](https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement), [Cloudflare](https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/).

## Links to other sites

The website links to our social profiles and to other sites. We do not control them and a visit to one is governed by that site's policy.

## Controlling this yourself

Browser settings and content blockers can stop any of these requests, though pages may then look different or the contact form may not work. For questions, write to [privacy@atelieroptimatix.com](mailto:privacy@atelieroptimatix.com).
